      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Exercise induced hypotension was observed in 41 of 354 patients studied. Fourteen of 41 as against 3 out of the remaining 313 developed complications, like atrial and ventricular arrhythmias, heart block, severe angina and left ventricular failure. Close monitoring of BP during exercise testing is mandatory."},
